-of-range neighbors and non-finite candidates are ignored. With cutoff L, candidates above L stay unreached (+Infinity); without a cutoff L = +Infinity. At convergence c[v] = min_s(c0[s] + d(s,v)), restricted to &lt;= L, with path sums evaluated in f32. Chaotic: a visit may read costs improved earlier in the same round; rounds are not synchronous Bellman-Ford sweeps.</p></div></div><span class=\"lens-unknown\">unknown — relation values not captured</span><p>apple · single-hop</p></section>",
